# ADR-0012: Hono + Postgres + Resend + B2 (v2 backend)

Supersedes ADR-0011 (FastAPI). **Hono `api/` implementation deferred** — conventions only.

## Decision

| Concern | Choice |
|---------|--------|
| API | Node + Hono (TypeScript) in `api/` |
| ORM | Drizzle |
| Database | PostgreSQL + PostGIS on Hetzner |
| Auth | Custom Argon2id + JWT (`jose`) + Resend emails |
| Images | **Backblaze B2** presigned uploads only |
| Mobile | Flutter + repository pattern (ADR-0008) |

## Repo runbooks

- Stack rule: `.cursor/rules/stack-hono-baller-backend.mdc`
- Env migration: `docs/deploy/env-migration.md`
- Feature plan: `docs/architecture/feature-plan.md`
- v1 archive: branch `archive/v1-flutter-fastapi`

## Not in v2

- FastAPI `backend/` (interim until `api/` ships)
- Supabase Auth / `USE_LEGACY_SUPABASE`
- MinIO or non-B2 storage
